Get a few backlinks
====================
-Other sites linking to you signals trust and relevance — one of the strongest ranking factors, especially for new domains competing against established players.

* List your business on local directories (Justdial, Sulekha, local Ujjain business listings)
* Ask any local partners, hostels, or travel blogs to link to your site
* Get listed on Google Business Profile if you haven't already — this alone often boosts local search visibility significantly


